# Agnes 3.0 Flash — findings by Glyph Cluster

- Source: Agnes AI (`agnes-3.0-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 3.0 Flash
- **Short description:** Agnes 3.0 Flash is Agnes AI's next-generation text model for agentic coding and tool-driven workflows, positioned for stable execution, tool orchestration, long-context retention, and trustworthy delivery.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes AI API (`https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1`); model name `agnes-3.0-flash`. Documented endpoints: Chat Completions (`POST /v1/chat/completions`), Responses (`POST /v1/responses`), and Anthropic-compatible Messages (`POST /v1/messages`).
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date and knowledge cutoff not stated in verified public sources accessed for this report (2026-11-13).
- **IDs:** `agnes-ai/agnes-3.0-flash` (dataset/provider reference); API model `agnes-3.0-flash`.
- **Context window:** 512K tokens total; 65,536 maximum output tokens (vendor-documented).
- **Modalities:** Text and image URL input; text output. Tool/function calling supported; thinking mode supported via `chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking` (OpenAI-compatible) or `thinking` (Anthropic-compatible).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** List price: $0.005 / 1M cached input tokens, $0.05 / 1M input tokens, $0.15 / 1M output tokens. Angel User Trial Price listed as $0 for cached input, input, and output (vendor-documented; account/rate-limit terms apply).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (not disclosed in verified sources).

