### Notes (negative findings)

- Official Agnes documentation confirms model identity, API access, modalities, tool-calling/thinking support, context/output limits, and pricing, but does not publish verifiable benchmark tables or third-party evaluation numbers on the accessed pages.
- Web search was unavailable in this environment (HTTP 402 errors), limiting discovery of third-party leaderboard entries; direct fetches to likely leaderboard/model pages (e.g. Artificial Analysis model page path attempted) did not yield verified benchmark results for `agnes-3.0-flash`.
- Because no verified benchmark numbers were found, no normalized 1–100 scores are assigned in this report.

